     "varsMobile": {},
     "css": "[data-block=\"906506b927443c850954\"] { mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  ); border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius); }",
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p class=\"rte-large\" style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\">The <strong>Voices of the Vulnerable (VV) Service Project</strong> is taking place in Spain in June 2024 in collaboration with the NGO, <em>Soñar Despierto.</em> This unique initiative offers students a chance to immerse themselves in impactful, hands-on service, engaging with local communities and making a genuine difference. Through the VV Project, we aim to redefine what it means to serve by guiding students to leverage their unique skills to uplift vulnerable populations.</p>"
    },
    {
     "id": "c1748a13e6fff3ae759e",
     "mobile": {
      "rowStart": 34,
      "colStart": 2,
      "rowEnd": 56,
      "colEnd": 10,
