      "align": "center"
     },
     "desktop": {
      "rowStart": 13,
      "colStart": 11,
      "rowEnd": 23,
      "colEnd": 24,
      "z": 5,
      "justify": "flex-start",
      "align": "flex-start"
     },
     "vars": {
      "--stroke-style": "none",
      "--stroke-thickness": "6px",
      "--tweak-text-block-padding": "initial",
      "--tweak-text-block-radius": "0px 0px 0px 0px",
      "--tweak-text-block-blend": "normal",
      "--blur-value": "blur(15px)"
     },
     "varsMobile": {},
     "css": "[data-block=\"c1748a13e6fff3ae759e\"] { mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  ); border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius); }",
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"--hl-thickness: 0.1em\" class=\"rte-highlight rte-highlight--underline\"></span>Through this immersive experience, you’ll:</h4><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>#1   Learn to Understand and Address Real Community Needs</strong><br>Engage deeply with local communities, learning firsthand about their challenges and discovering effective ways to help.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>#2  Apply Your Personal Talents to Drive Change</strong><br>Use your unique strengths—whether academic, athletic, artistic, or leadership-based—to make a lasting impact.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>#3  Develop Empathy and Social Responsibility</strong><br>Build a meaningful connection with underserved communities, fostering a greater sense of empathy and social awareness.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>#4  Gain Practical Leadership Experience</strong><br>Take on leadership roles and gain skills that will prepare you for future projects and initiatives.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>#5  Enhance Your College Application with Quality Service</strong><br>Stand out by demonstrating your commitment to meaningful, authentic service.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>#6  Connect with Like-Minded Peers</strong><br>Form bonds with other passionate students who share your drive to create positive change</p>"
    },
