     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Apply Now for Your Chance to Join:</strong></h4><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>Early Admission:</strong> October 2024</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><strong>Regular Admission:</strong> January 2024</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\"><em>*Apply today for a chance to join the 2025 Voices of the Vulnerable Service Project!</em>*</p>"
